    "text": "<p>The Fischer projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-erythrose is shown below.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_9e640b534a85.png\"/> </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-Erythrose and its isomers are listed as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> in Column I. Choose the correct relationship of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>-erythrose from Column II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\"><tbody><tr><td> </td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Column - I</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"> </td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Column -II</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">P.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_87cfeabf1519.png\"/></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Diastereomer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Q.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_cd53d02a23e1.png\"/></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Identical</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">R.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_703a2d34e13f.png\"/></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">3.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Enantiomer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">S.</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_5e8121bf2e4d.png\"/></td><td> </td><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><p> </p><p> </p>"
